## Apêndice A: Targets Make Completos

| Target | Função |
|--------|--------|
| `make dev` | Dev server com watch + mint dev (porta 3000) |
| `make build` | Build estático para `./build` |
| `make install` | uv sync + npm install + mint CLI + skills linking |
| `make test` | pytest com socket blocking |
| `make test-code-samples` | Executar code samples (FILES=, CODE_SAMPLE_JOBS=) |
| `make update-code-sample-traces` | Trace samples → LangSmith → regenerar MDX |
| `make code-snippets` | Extrair snippets Bluehawk → gerar MDX |
| `make lint` | ruff format + check + ty + codespell |
| `make format` | ruff format + fix |
| `make format-check` | Verificação sem modificação (CI) |
| `make lint_md` | markdownlint em src/ |
| `make lint_md_fix` | markdownlint --fix |
| `make lint_prose` | Vale prose linting |
| `make check-mdx` | Validar componentes/sintaxe MDX |
| `make check-openapi` | Validar specs OpenAPI |
| `make check-cross-refs` | Validar @[ref] cross-references |
| `make broken-links` | Link check (sem âncoras) |
| `make broken-links-with-anchors` | Link check completo + redirects |
| `make check-legacy-links` | Verificar links legados |
| `make export` | mint export (Enterprise only) |
| `make htmltest` | Validar HTML exportado (external URLs) |
| `make export-htmltest` | export + htmltest sequencial |
| `make clean` | Remover build/ + __pycache__ |
| `make skills` | Symlink .agents/skills → .claude/skills |
| `make help` | Listar todos os targets |

